        <item>
            <title>1.2.0</title>
            <pubDate>Tue, 25 Aug 2026 20:25:13 -0400</pubDate>
            <link>https://github.com/zats/chat-gpt-x</link>
            <sparkle:version>2</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.2.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>26.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[<h1 id="chatgptx-120">ChatGPTX 1.2.0</h1>
<h2 id="automatic-launcher-updates">Automatic launcher updates</h2>
<p>ChatGPTX now checks for launcher updates automatically. It downloads
and installs signed updates through Sparkle so that future launcher
versions can arrive without a manual download.</p>
<p>The ChatGPTX application menu and status menu now show the current
update state. You can check again, retry a failed check, or install a
downloaded update from either menu.</p>
<p>This release does not change the separate update system for ChatGPT
API bindings, the runtime, or extensions.</p>
]]></description>
